      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "安政六己未ヨリ　文久三癸亥マテ　五ヶ年平均　願濟ニヨリテ五ヶ年平均　安政ヨリ癸亥マテヲ用ユ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "安政六年己未より文久三年癸亥まで、五ヶ年平均。願済によりて五ヶ年平均、安政より癸亥までを用ゆ。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Five-year average, from Ansei 6 (tsuchinoto-hitsuji, 1859) to Bunkyu 3 (mizunoto-i, 1863). Because the petition was granted, the five-year average running from Ansei to the mizunoto-i year is the one used. Printed as two warichu (double-column) runs flanking a full-size 五ヶ年平均."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "高五ヶ年平均割註"
